{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_04_beg","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_st02","title":"铁人三项","storyCode":"DH-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e4bfead2b60ae12f42908f2d8b0afbe8ece0af734d04e7d107e3fbc86c4a4116","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"罗德岛的干员们也出现在了会场观看比赛。\n第二轮铁人三项比赛开始，鼠胆龙威队再一次被其他队伍包围。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，先来一点音乐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，经过一天的等待，我们即将迎来大奖赛的第二轮比赛——铁人三项！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"20_I02_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比赛规则十分简单，先是跑步，再是骑行，最后是游泳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妨碍他人？没有问题！只要队伍中有一个人抵达终点就算出线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抄近道是被允许的，但是要当心那埋伏在巷道里的家伙！他们可不会轻易让你通过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，抵达终点的人，如果没有通过骑行和游泳的两个检查点的话，成绩是不被认可的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，选手们可以在比赛开始后转身就跳入海中游上游轮，但那只会让你成为全城的笑柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是个富豪，近地飞行器也是个可选项！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果不讨好观众的话，可是有可能被投票出局的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，由于第一轮出线的队伍是十五支，加上一支通过观众投票复活的队伍，第一轮一共出线十六支队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因此，第二轮的出线数量将是八支。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最先抵达游轮的八支队伍将获得出线的权利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，让我们接下来有请十六支参赛队伍登场！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好漂亮的海......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来这座城市果然没白来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就在这里坐下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然我还是回去吧，会给这里的其他人添麻烦的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太在意。这座城市好像不太在乎感染者问题的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很明显，这并不是因为他们开明，而是他们不在乎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，有苏苏洛跟着，不会有问题的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。艾雅法拉小姐的病症我心里有数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实你与其担心给别人添麻烦，更应该担心的是自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比其他人都要更加久居室内，这不仅对身体不好，对精神卫生也有影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是这一次我作为医生赞成将艾雅法拉小姐你带到这里来的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人都应该拥有享受阳光的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然博士那边也是遇到了麻烦，但是隔着屏幕听说他们在度假那叫什么事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们艾雅法拉也该有个休假才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我是自愿做地质研究的，而且要是耽误大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你就别操心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来这边也是有正当理由的，罗德岛想要在这座城市设立办事处，一直没有得到这座城市市长的同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅让我们来再当一次说客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就安心在这里享受比赛节目吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，红呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她好像不打算出来，一个人不知道哪里去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，这家伙出任务以来就是这个样子，我也习惯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，快看，来了来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们欢迎，鼠胆龙威队！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是分头行动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铁人三项赛程很长，各做各的很容易失去联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他队伍里除了单独分出人来妨碍其他队伍，基本上都是共同行动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位要是没有类似的想法我还是建议一起行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以。动手的时候别妨碍我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原话奉还。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是没想到，一开始看电视我还以为看错了，没想到陈也来到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来她也在度假中，等比赛结束后，我们去和她打个招呼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铸铁","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你们先看，我去给你们买点吃的，你们就在这里不要随意走动啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"以上就是所有十六支队伍的介绍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"和第一轮一样，为了让观众们也享受到参与比赛的乐趣，我们为观众们也准备了丰富多彩的投注竞猜项目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"各位观众在官方网站上登录自己的信息后可以为自己赚一笔外快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"具体操作流程请参照官方发布的比赛指南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"第二轮比赛中，我们的嘉宾配置将有所变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"潘乔先生为了准备第三轮比赛已经先一步前往了游轮上，他将通过视频连线的方式和观众们对话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，参赛选手们已经都来到了预备线上，请坎黛拉女士来为我们拉响第二轮的礼炮吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩得高兴点，年轻人们。我宣布——第二轮比赛，正式开始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们又被盯上了，两位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速战速决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
